ral population, suggesting possible sampling bias.\n","\n","These findings provide the foundation for the final analysis and support the development of marketing recommendations for Bellabeat's wellness products.\n","\n","# Advanced Exploratory Data Analysis\n","\n","## Create Additional Features\n","To better understand user behaviour, create additional variables that can be used throughout the analysis."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":16,"id":"c52f3f69","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-01T10:51:36.189453Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-01T10:51:36.187944Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-01T10:51:36.206915Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-01T10:51:36.205107Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.044161,"end_time":"2026-08-01T10:51:36.2095","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-08-01T10:51:36.165339","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[],"source":["activity_sleep <- activity_sleep %>%\n","  mutate(sleep_hours = totalminutesasleep / 60,\n","    calories_per_step = calories / ifelse(totalsteps == 0, 1, totalsteps),\n","    weekend = ifelse(\n","      weekday %in% c(\"Saturday\",\"Sunday\"),\n","      \"Weekend\",\n","      \"Weekday\"),\n","    sleep_quality = case_when(\n","      totalminutesasleep < 360 ~ \"Poor\",\n","      totalminutesasleep >= 360 &\n","      totalminutesasleep < 480 ~ \"Adequate\",\n","      totalminutesasleep >= 480 ~ \"Excellent\"))\n"," "]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"9e2d5bed","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.020507,"end_time":"2026-08-01T10:51:36.250424","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-08-01T10:51:36.229917","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["#### Visualisation 6\n","\n","##### Sleep Quality"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":17,"id":"0dfbf4e9","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-01T10:51:36.295427Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-01T10:51:36.293779Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-01T10:51:36.521916Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-01T10:51:36.519974Z"},"papermill":{"dura