cipants regularly tracked sleep, suggesting that sleep tracking features may require improved engagement.\n","\n","#### Finding 4\n","Activity levels vary across the week. Weekday movement is generally greater than weekend movement.\n","\n","#### Finding 5\n","Most Fitbit users in the sample appear relatively active. This suggests possible sampling bias because Fitbit owners may already be more health-conscious than the broader population.\n","\n","### Top high-level content recommendations based on analysis\n","* How could these trends apply to Bellabeat customers?\n","* How could these trends help influence Bellabeat marketing strategy?\n","Current positioning: tech-driven wellness company for women\n","Current marketing channels: traditional advertising media, such as radio, out-of-home billboards, print, and television, but focuses on digital marketing — Google Search, active Facebook and Instagram pages, and Twitter. Video ads on Youtube and display ads on the Google Display Network to support campaigns around key marketing dates\n","\n","#### Recommendation 1: Promote Daily Movement Goals\n","Develop personalised campaigns encouraging users to achieve 10,000 daily steps.\n","The analysis demonstrates a strong relationship between daily step count and overall calorie expenditure.\n","Bellabeat could introduce:\n","- Daily challenges\n","- Achievement badges\n","- Push notifications\n","- Weekly goal tracking\n","\n","#### Recommendation 2: Improve Sleep Tracking Engagement\n","Many participants did not consistently record sleep data.\n","Bellabeat should encourage users to wear their devices overnight by providing:\n","- Morning sleep summaries\n","- Weekly sleep reports\n","- Sleep quality scores\n","- Personalised bedtime reminders\n","\n","#### Recommendation 3: Reduce Sedentary Behaviour\n","Although many users are active, they still spend several hours sedentary.\n","Bellabeat could implement:\n","- Hourly movement reminders\n","- Stretch notifications\n","- Office wellness challenges\n","- Standing goals\n","\n","#### Recommendation 4: Personalised Wellness Insights\n","Use activity and sleep data together to deliver customised coaching through the Bellabeat app.\n","For example: \"If you increase your daily activity by 2,000 steps while maintaining at least seven hours of sleep, you could improve your weekly wellness score.\"\n","\n","## Limitations\n","Several limitations should be acknowledged:\n","- Small sample size (30 users)\n","- Only one month of observations\n","- Data collected in 2016\n","- Missing sleep records for some participants\n","- Weight logging is voluntary and contains many missing observations\n","\n","Therefore, conclusions should be interpreted as indicative rather than representative of all smart device users. Future work should incorporate more recent and representative datasets, including additional demographic information where available.\n","\n","## Conclusion\n","This analysis demonstrates that Fitbit users generally exhibit moderate to high levels of physical activity, with strong relationships observed between daily steps, active minutes, and calories burned.\n","Despite these positive behaviours, sedentary time remains substantial, and sleep tracking is inconsistent.\n","\n","These findings suggest that Bellabeat can strengthen user engagement through personalised coaching, movement reminders, and enhanced sleep-tracking features. By integrating these insights into the Bellabeat Leaf ecosystem, the company can improve customer retention while reinforcing its brand as a holistic wellness platform.\n","\n","#### References\n","* Source: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/arashnic/fitbit\n","* Original provider: Fitabase LLC\n","* License: CC0 Public Domain\n","* The dataset contains personal fitness tracker data from thirty Fitbit users collected between March 12 and April 11, 2016."]}],"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"display_name":"R","language":"R","name":"ir"},"language_info":{"codemirror_mode":"r","file_extension":".r","mimetype":"text/x-r-source","name":"R","pygments_lexer":"r","version":"4.4.0"},"papermill":{"default_parameters":{},"duration":15.744569,"end_time":"2026-08-01T10:51:38.271253","environment_variables":{},"exception":null,"input_path":"__notebook__.ipynb","output_path":"__notebook__.ipynb","parameters":{},"start_time":"2026-08-01T10:51:22.526684","version":"2.6.0"}},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":5}